  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3a975e36eca21da4383cab3d1f951b27, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - Years ago, the world's greatest scientists had discovered a cure for cancer.
  - This cure was celebrated around the world, but it had an unfortunate effect tied
    to it.
  - When exposed to plant life, the cure would bring them to life. Worse still, this
    would spread to other plants.
  - In a matter of days, plants across the world came to life, and wrought havoc
  - This cataclysmic event would lead to the collapse of modern society
  - But of course, humanity endured. Though weakened and scattered, humans still
    forge ahead.
  - However, life is not easy. Hostile plants are everywhere.
  - Recently, the city of Portland, once a sanctuary for humanity, was overrun by
    plants.
  - One of those inhabitants, named Skyler, has decided to leave the ruins of the
    city.
  - With her trusty camper van, she has plotted a course for the nearby town of Government
    Camp.
  - However, the journey will be perilous, and how it will end remains to be seen...
